*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~100 seconds<sup>1,600f~3,000f</sup>.
