==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Okinawa Prefecture'''.
*Hawaii and [[Maldives (Empire of Cats)|Maldives]] are the only locations visited in [[Empire of Cats]] not to appear in [[Into the Future]].
*Okinawa Prefecture's base is a statue of a ''[[wikipedia:Shisa|shisha]]'', an Okinawan mythological creature resembling a cross between a lion and a dog, said to ward against evil spirits. The flower on its head is an ''[[wikipedia:Hibiscus makinoi|Okinawan hibiscus]]''.
*The Enemy Base is most likely based off [[wikipedia:Kīlauea|Kīlauea]], a shield volcano which is not only the most active among the Fire Volcanoes, but is also one of the most active volcanoes in the world.

